OL,3,GNEWSANI health trusts to announce 12%
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health and social
OL,7,Fcare trusts are expected to announce
OL,8,Fproposals on how they intend to make
OL,9,Fsavings of up to 12%.
OL,11,FHealth unions have said services and
OL,12,Fjobs will be affected, including
OL,13,Fporters and cleaners.
OL,15,FBBC News NI's Health Correspondent
OL,16,FMarie-Louise Connolly provides some
OL,17,Fanalysis on what we can expect.
OL,19,FThe scale of the required savings is
OL,20,Fsignificant. At the moment, health
OL,21,Ffaces a funding gap of #800m.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
